 {
  "perek": 6,
  "mishnah": 2,
  "summary": "If you made the wrong bracha on food, sometimes it still counts, and \"Shehakol\" works for everything.",
  "chunks": [
   {
    "he": "בֵּרַךְ עַל פֵּרוֹת הָאִילָן",
    "en": "If someone said on tree fruit",
    "words": [
     {
      "he": "בֵּרַךְ",
      "en": "he blessed"
     },
     {
      "he": "עַל",
      "en": "on"
     },
     {
      "he": "פֵּרוֹת",
      "en": "fruits of"
     },
     {
      "he": "הָאִילָן",
      "en": "the tree"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "he": "בּוֹרֵא פְּרִי הָאֲדָמָה, יָצָא.",
    "en": "\"Borei pri ha'adamah,\" it still counts.",
    "words": [
     {
      "he": "בּוֹרֵא",
      "en": "Who creates"
     },
     {
      "he": "פְּרִי",
      "en": "fruit of"
     },
     {
      "he": "הָאֲדָמָה,",
      "en": "the ground"
     },
     {
      "he": "יָצָא.",
      "en": "he fulfilled it",
      "note": "He did the mitzvah and does not need to say it again."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "he": "וְעַל פֵּרוֹת הָאָרֶץ בּוֹרֵא פְּרִי הָעֵץ,",
    "en": "But if he said on food from the ground \"Borei pri ha'etz,\"",
    "words": [
     {
      "he": "וְעַל",
      "en": "and on"
     },
     {
      "he": "פֵּרוֹת",
      "en": "fruits of"
     },
     {
      "he": "הָאָרֶץ",
      "en": "the earth"
     },
     {
      "he": "בּוֹרֵא",
      "en": "Who creates"
     },
     {
      "he": "פְּרִי",
      "en": "fruit of"
     },
     {
      "he": "הָעֵץ,",
      "en": "the tree"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "he": "לֹא יָצָא.",
    "en": "it does not count.",
    "words": [
     {
      "he": "לֹא",
      "en": "not"
     },
     {
      "he": "יָצָא.",
      "en": "he fulfilled it"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "he": "עַל כֻּלָּם אִם אָמַר שֶׁהַכֹּל נִהְיָה, יָצָא:",
    "en": "On any food, if he said \"Shehakol nihyah bidvaro,\" it counts.",
    "words": [
     {
      "he": "עַל",
      "en": "on"
     },
     {
      "he": "כֻּלָּם",
      "en": "all of them"
     },
     {
      "he": "אִם",
      "en": "if"
     },
     {
      "he": "אָמַר",
      "en": "he said"
     },
     {
      "he": "שֶׁהַכֹּל",
      "en": "that everything",
      "note": "The bracha \"Shehakol,\" meaning everything came to be by Hashem's word."
     },
     {
      "he": "נִהְיָה,",
      "en": "came to be"
     },
     {
      "he": "יָצָא:",
      "en": "he fulfilled it"
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
